OL,3,AGlobal scramble to fix critical
OL,4,Acyber-security flaw - we're answering
OL,5,Ayour questions
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe issue may affect around 30 million
OL,8,Fwebsites and could allow attackers to
OL,9,Fsteal personal data, one expert tells
OL,10,Fthe BBC
OL,12,FThe Office for Budget Responsibility
OL,13,Ftook its site offline yesterday, as did
OL,14,FNHS Scotland. Some parts of Wikipedia
OL,15,Fwere unavailable, while Amazon says it
OL,16,Fdetected an attempt by hackers to
OL,17,Fexploit the flaws - see more affected
OL,18,Fsites here
